/T (Furthermore, the vast scale of AI outputs creates a verification crisis. When an AI produces a proof spanning hundreds of thousands of lines of machine logic or Lean code, human peer review becomes nearly impossible without using another AI to verify the first. This reliance on machine-checking-machine risks creating a closed loop of trust, raising concerns about subtle software glitches, hidden systemic biases, or in the case of Lean, which requires code to compile to verify its truth, code filled with tautologies all for the purpose of achieving a proof.)
/E (Furthermore, the vast scale of AI outputs creates a verification crisis. When an AI produces a proof spanning hundreds of thousands of lines of machine logic or Lean code, human peer review becomes nearly impossible without using another AI to verify the first. This reliance on machine-checking-machine risks creating a closed loop of trust, raising concerns about subtle software glitches, hidden systemic biases, or in the case of Lean, which requires code to compile to verify its truth, code filled with tautologies all for the purpose of achieving a proof.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
