/E (The transcript you just read was 4 minutes after CAPCOM told the astronauts to stir the cryo tanks. This resulted in the instruments recording a drop in voltage in the Main A channel. This combined with a sudden jolt just after stirring was more than enough evidence that something had gone wrong. During the transcript the astronauts also realised that they were venting gas. The only gasses on board were fuel and oxidiser. They were venting fuel.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
