/T (Later investigations found that a poorly insulated wire was next to one of the Oxygen tanks. All it needed was a disturbance to ignite some of the fuel and cause the explosion, the disturbance being the stirring of the Oxygen tanks 56 hours in. Later missions carried out the experiments that were meant to be carried out by Apollo 13, no scientific knowledge was lost in the long term. )
/E (Later investigations found that a poorly insulated wire was next to one of the Oxygen tanks. All it needed was a disturbance to ignite some of the fuel and cause the explosion, the disturbance being the stirring of the Oxygen tanks 56 hours in. Later missions carried out the experiments that were meant to be carried out by Apollo 13, no scientific knowledge was lost in the long term. )
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [1]
