/P 375 0 R
/E (Greater accessibility to advanced genetic engineering tools, such as CRISPR-Cas9, has decreased the cost whilst improving the programmability of genome editing.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
646 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 375 0 R
/E (Lower technical barriers increase the number of actors capable of using complex genetic engineering . This increases the challenge for current biosecurity systems. Although progress in dual-use research is necessary to advance legitimate scientific research, we must prepare our infrastructure to prevent misuse of technology.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [7]
>>
