648 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 375 0 R
/E (The availability of genetic sequence data has expanded. As we collect more information about pathogens through legitimate research, more biological data is available that could be misused. Capable actors may therefore face fewer technical barriers to engineering pathogens than before. )
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
