/Title (Finally, I would argue that AI companies are currently using mathematical problems as simple benchmarks for their newest models, racing to complete problems, not to further mathematical understanding but to show off their raw computational capabilities and secure market dominance. This shifts the motivation of research from genuine intellectual curiosity to corporate branding.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 3146 0 R
/Next 3150 0 R
>>
endobj
