/Title (All the same, the mission still went ahead as all missions had before them. The Saturn V rocket had two stages to get to Low Earth Orbit and a transfer stage to accelerate the ship to the Moon. The first stage was by far the most powerful vehicle built at the time, capable of 33 MN of thrust, equivalent to 27 million horsepower, burning through its 2 million kg of thrust within only 2.5 minutes, accelerating the craft up to 8 times the speed of sound, faster than any aeroplane.)
